## F. Final recommendation

Use:

```cpp
double hardness = 400.0;
double p = 2.4;
double epsilon = 0.51;
double tau0 = 0.0004;
```

Use `2.0 m/s` as the current reference impact velocity. This is not a timbre preference: it is the best-supported measured Renner set, it is numerically resolved at the project sample rate, and it is the only tested published family that remains coherent across the full practical velocity sweep under the approved contact-state rule.
